(a) n_z . n_x = sqrt(2)*sin(2*theta)/2 - cos(2*theta)/4 + 1/4
    perpendicular at theta in {0, -pi/2 + atan(4*sqrt(2)/7)/2}
    parallel (|dot|=1) at theta in {-atan(2*sqrt(2))/2 + pi/2}
    theta = 0  n_z = [0, 0, 1]  n_x = [1, 0, 0]
    theta = atan(sqrt(2))  n_z = [sqrt(3)/3, sqrt(3)/3, sqrt(3)/3]  n_x = [sqrt(3)/3, sqrt(3)/3, sqrt(3)/3]
    theta = -atan(2*sqrt(2))  n_z = [-2/3, -2/3, 1/3]  n_x = [1/3, -2/3, -2/3]
    d-branch: n_z = d_z, n_x = [0, sqrt(2)/2, -sqrt(2)/2]  dot = -1/2
(b) n_a = e_a                max |[alpha(sw_x), alpha(b_y)]| over mixed controls = 1.2172  (nonzero => not an automorphism)
(b) n_a = (I - 2ww^T) e_a    max |[alpha(sw_x), alpha(b_y)]| over mixed controls = 0.3542  (nonzero => not an automorphism)
